Z||000000||sqoach||12-19-2001||10:41 PM||||Well, I've been looking for some exhaust tips for a little while now, and found what I was looking for! Did some late Christmas shopping today and found a muffler shop. Here's a pic of what I got. I really like them!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/exhaust_tips.JPG"> <P>So, what do ya think?<BR>I plan on getting these and my new muffler put on real soon, maybe tomorrow. I'll post some pics once they're on. Can't wait!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>                  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif">   <BR><B>86 SE V6 - daily driver</B>||||reg||10
