Z||000008||Rodney||12-20-2001||09:05 AM||||I will soon be offering these same 304 stainless steel tips with 304 stainless steel exhaust pipes welded on for a direct replacement for GT style tips. List price looks to be about $75 each. I will also be using these for my new exhaust systems for the GT type rear bumpers. ||||reg||1
Z||000009||sqoach||12-20-2001||02:02 PM||||Thanks for the kind words    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I got these at a muffler shop in Enid. It's about an hour away from here. They were pricey. $50 a side. I figured I should get some that I really like, instead of some cheaper ones that I didn't like as much. And since these are stainless steel, they'll last a long time. JCWhitney sells some almost idectical to these. They're $40 each on their website, but then you have to pay for s/h. So it works out about the same. Here's a link to the JCWhitney ones.<BR> <A HREF="http://jcwhitney.com/item.jhtml?ITEMID=56075&BQ=jcw2" TARGET=_blank>http://jcwhitney.com/item.jhtml?ITEMID=56075&BQ=jcw2</A> <p>[This message has been edited by sqoach (edited 12-20-2001).]||||reg||1
